  "change": "Resolve fill, fill-opacity, fill-rule and markers together in one style-parent walk per path paint. Stack-owned strong references; no added node fields, permanent cache, or style map. Other inherited properties retain their existing resolution paths. Rebuilds re-resolve values so edits and reparenting remain visible.",
  "interpretation": "Modest first-draw improvement on Pcolormesh 2; other fixture first-draw time is effectively unchanged. No parsing code changed in this step; parse-time differences are run variation. Identical first and warm RGBA pixels in all paired runs. Memory differences are small relative to process/allocator variation; no permanent storage added to nodes.",
